model.en:
Initialise EVERY field unconditionally, in one fixed order, using defaults (<code>null</code>) for absent data — so all instances walk one transition path to one hidden class:<br><code>function makeNode(input) {
  return {
    type: input.type,
    parent: input.parent ?? null,
    x: input.x,
    y: input.y,
    style: input.style ?? null,
    children: input.children ?? null,
  };
}</code><br>Key moves: no <code>if</code>-guarded fields, no late additions, a constant key order, and <code>null</code> for missing values instead of omission. The object literal with all keys present IS the stable shape — V8 caches one leaf hidden class and every node reuses it, keeping the render-loop access site monomorphic and inlinable by TurboFan.

